{"id":510444657,"name":"CRIMINAL VS. SWAT ","desc":"Welcome to Criminal vs Swat! Live the life of a Swat Officer or a Criminal. Fly planes helicopters or drive boats to defeat your enemy. Your weapons will help you save the day if you can stay alive.\n\nmobile, fps, military, guns, gun, shotgun, sniper, helicopter, war, battle, guns, tablet ","path":"/game/510444657-criminal-vs-swat","slug":"510444657-criminal-vs-swat","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0ed37301866a0fac5ff40be134e7c38fb4f2650d7fd8f123d53dadf6ee36e7d1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-63ace25e6d09883f40f818a8932b5132/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":9,"visitor":314143760,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-21T21:38:27.545Z","creator":{"name":"Wolfpaq","type":"User"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"CRIMINAL-VS.-SWAT-OP-Auto-Farm-40k-an-hour-137938","_id":"69bf0583e774dfd560d5d629","title":"OP Auto Farm 40k an hour","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78129","gameId":510444657,"name":"CRIMINAL VS. SWAT ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":510444657},"features":"S.W.A.T. Money Autofarm Script\n\nThis script automatically farms money by repeatedly completing the ball objective in the S.W.A.T. game mode. It handles the entire process from start to finish for maximum cash efficiency.\n\nFeatures:\n- Auto Team Assignment – Automatically touches Swatspawn until you're placed on the S.W.A.T. team\n- Intelligent Ball Detection – Waits for the ball to become available (Transparency 0 and no owner)\n- Auto Collection – Automatically touches the ball to pick it up\n- Auto Delivery – Automatically touches VaultSWAT to score and earn money\n- Round Reset – Detects when the ball is deleted (round ends), waits 60 seconds, then respawns you to continue farming\n- Error Handling – Prevents \"primitives overlap\" errors by validating all parts before interactions\n- Continuous Loop – Runs indefinitely until manually stopped\n\nHow to Use:\n1. Load the script into your executor\n2. Execute while in the game\n3. Let it run – the script handles everything automatically\n4. Earn money passively while AFK\n\nRequirements:\n- Your executor MUST have `firetouchinterest`, otherwise the script will not work.\n\nNote: The script runs on a continuous loop, automatically restarting after each successful delivery or round end. Perfect for AFK money farming.","tags":["swat","criminal","roblox","auto","farm"],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal swatspawn = workspace:FindFirstChild(\"Swatspawn\")\n\nif swatspawn then\n    repeat\n        local hrp = player.Character and player.Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n        firetouchinterest(hrp, swatspawn, 0)\n        firetouchinterest(hrp, swatspawn, 1)\n        task.wait(2)\n    until player.Team and player.Team.Name == \"S.W.A.T.\"\nend\n\ntask.wait(1)\n\nwhile true do\n    local model = workspace:FindFirstChild(\"Model\")\n    if model then\n        local ball = model:FindFirstChild(\"Ball\")\n        \n        if ball then\n            local ballBall = ball:FindFirstChild(\"Ball\")\n            \n            if ballBall then\n                local owner = ballBall:FindFirstChild(\"Owner\")\n                \n                if ballBall.Transparency == 0 and (not owner or owner.Value == nil) then\n                    local hrp = player.Character and player.Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n                    \n                    if hrp and ballBall then\n                        firetouchinterest(hrp, ballBall, 0)\n                        task.wait(0.1)\n                        firetouchinterest(hrp, ballBall, 1)\n                        task.wait(0.5)\n                        \n                        local vault = ball:FindFirstChild(\"VaultSWAT\")\n                        if vault and hrp then\n                            firetouchinterest(hrp, vault, 0)\n                            task.wait(0.1)\n                            firetouchinterest(hrp, vault, 1)\n                        end\n                    end\n                end\n            end\n        else\n            print(\"Ball deleted, game over. Waiting 60 seconds...\")\n            task.wait(60)\n            \n            local swatspawn = workspace:FindFirstChild(\"Swatspawn\")\n            if swatspawn then\n                local hrp = player.Character and player.Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n                if hrp then\n                    firetouchinterest(hrp, swatspawn, 0)\n                    task.wait(0.1)\n                    firetouchinterest(hrp, swatspawn, 1)\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    end\n    \n    task.wait(0.5)\nend","owner":{"_id":"68188318a01a1531fed13577","username":"imjustanaIienguy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/872065088c323d08177ca1368488d01caa0a11cfba8609e38007c6eb0e83b6c8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68188318a01a1531fed13577-1774215288525.png"},"status":"offline","id":"68188318a01a1531fed13577","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/872065088c323d08177ca1368488d01caa0a11cfba8609e38007c6eb0e83b6c8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68188318a01a1531fed13577-1774215288525.png"}},"verified":false,"views":780,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/3f1490e3a907997035f0fc37452d123d8e595c8b5d41ca879cdf0b0d39f93ada.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-b259c5d8e67d4bbf1abf2fda9d9ada28-8ac2d0e5ee12.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-b259c5d8e67d4bbf1abf2fda9d9ada28-8ac2d0e5ee1